    {
      "heading": "What if I'm done?",
      "body": "You can export the json file or print it directly from Print\n\nOf course you can load a saved json in so you can also share with collaborators!\n\nUse your Library to see all the Zines you've worked on and choose from any zines that are hosted. <div><br></div><div><br></div>",
